#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1. Install the required packages {#step-1-install-the-required-packages}"
msgstr "Langkah 1. Pasang pakej yang diperlukan {#step-1-install-the-required-packages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executor and the directed execution model require the `samplomatic` package:\n"
msgstr "Executor dan model pelaksanaan terarah memerlukan pakej `samplomatic`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Version notes\">\n"
"- `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48.0 is recommended because it adds the `meas_level = \"both\"` option and the `local_c1` twirling group.\n"
"- `qiskit >= 2.3.0` is required.\n"
"- `samplomatic >= 0.18.0` is required.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Version notes\">\n"
"- `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48.0 disyorkan kerana ia menambah pilihan `meas_level = \"both\"` dan kumpulan twirling `local_c1`.\n"
"- `qiskit >= 2.3.0` diperlukan.\n"
"- `samplomatic >= 0.18.0` diperlukan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"imports\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2. Change the imports {#step-2-change-the-imports}"
msgstr "Langkah 2. Ubah import {#step-2-change-the-imports}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Sampler:**\n"
msgstr "**Sampler:**\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Executor:**\n"
msgstr "**Executor:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"circuit-samplex\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3. Replace PUB tuples with a `QuantumProgram` {#step-3-replace-pub-tuples-with-a-quantumprogram}"
msgstr "Langkah 3. Gantikan tuple PUB dengan `QuantumProgram` {#step-3-replace-pub-tuples-with-a-quantumprogram}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of passing a list of tuples (PUBs), when using Executor, you build a `QuantumProgram` and append _items_ to it.\n"
msgstr "Bukannya menghantar senarai tuple (PUB), apabila menggunakan Executor, kamu membina `QuantumProgram` dan melampirkan _item_ kepadanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `QuantumProgram` accepts _circuit_ items and _samplex_ items:\n"
msgstr "`QuantumProgram` menerima item _circuit_ dan item _samplex_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`append_circuit_item`: Appends a `CircuitItem`, which is a circuit and (optionally) its\n"
"parameter values. It is executed as-is, without any randomization. \n"
msgstr ""
"`append_circuit_item`: Melampirkan `CircuitItem`, iaitu circuit dan (secara pilihan) nilai\n"
"parameternya. Ia dilaksanakan sebagaimana adanya, tanpa sebarang rawakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Use this when you just want to sample a circuit, exactly as Sampler would with a PUB that has no\n"
"  twirling; for example, when submitting a plain sampling job, or when you already manually included any\n"
"  variants you want.\n"
"- `append_samplex_item`: Appends a `samplexItem`, which is a *template circuit* plus a\n"
"  *samplex* that generates randomized parameter sets on the server side. \n"
msgstr ""
"  Gunakan ini apabila kamu hanya mahu mensampel circuit, tepat seperti Sampler lakukan dengan PUB yang tiada\n"
"  twirling; contohnya, apabila menyerahkan kerja pensampelan biasa, atau apabila kamu sudah\n"
"  memasukkan secara manual varian yang kamu mahu.\n"
"- `append_samplex_item`: Melampirkan `samplexItem`, iaitu *circuit templat* ditambah\n"
"  *samplex* yang menjana set parameter rawak di sisi pelayan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Use this\n"
"  when you want the circuit's content randomized. The primary case is with \n"
"  twirling (gate or measurement) or noise injection. This capability replaces\n"
"  Sampler's built-in twirling.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Gunakan ini\n"
"  apabila kamu mahu kandungan circuit dirawakkan. Kes utama adalah dengan\n"
"  twirling (gate atau pengukuran) atau suntikan hingar. Keupayaan ini menggantikan\n"
"  twirling terbina dalam Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A single `QuantumProgram` can accept both item types; each appended item is executed as an\n"
"independent task and produces its own entry in the results. In general, use `append_circuit_item` when your circuit does not need to be randomized. Otherwise, use `append_samplex_item`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu `QuantumProgram` boleh menerima kedua-dua jenis item; setiap item yang dilampirkan dilaksanakan sebagai\n"
"tugas bebas dan menghasilkan entrinya sendiri dalam hasil. Secara umum, gunakan `append_circuit_item` apabila circuit kamu tidak perlu dirawakkan. Jika tidak, gunakan `append_samplex_item`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The next sections show each in turn: parameterized circuits that use \n"
"`append_circuit_item`, and migrating twirling by using `append_samplex_item`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian seterusnya menunjukkan setiap satu secara bergilir: circuit berparameter yang menggunakan\n"
"`append_circuit_item`, dan memindahkan twirling dengan menggunakan `append_samplex_item`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the following code examples, `isa_circuit` refers to the circuit that has been transpiled to conform to the target backend's [Instruction Set Architecture](/guides/transpile#instruction-set-architecture) (ISA). This `isa_circuit` contains two parameters.\n"
msgstr "Dalam contoh kod berikut, `isa_circuit` merujuk kepada circuit yang telah ditranspil untuk mematuhi [Instruction Set Architecture](/guides/transpile#instruction-set-architecture) (ISA) backend sasaran. `isa_circuit` ini mengandungi dua parameter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"param-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3a. Migrate parameterized circuits {#step-3a-migrate-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Langkah 3a. Pindahkan circuit berparameter {#step-3a-migrate-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With Sampler, parameter values are the second element of the PUB tuple. With Executor,\n"
"pass them as `circuit_arguments` to `append_circuit_item`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan Sampler, nilai parameter adalah elemen kedua tuple PUB. Dengan Executor,\n"
"hantarkannya sebagai `circuit_arguments` kepada `append_circuit_item`.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Executor**\n"
msgstr "**Executor**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"twirling\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3b. Migrate built-in twirling to explicit annotations {#step-3b-migrate-built-in-twirling-to-explicit-annotations}"
msgstr "Langkah 3b. Pindahkan twirling terbina dalam kepada anotasi eksplisit {#step-3b-migrate-built-in-twirling-to-explicit-annotations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is the most significant change. Sampler applies twirling for you by using options. With \n"
"Executor, you declare that intent explicitly by using annotated boxes and\n"
"a samplex (from [Samplomatic](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah perubahan yang paling ketara. Sampler menggunakan twirling untuk kamu dengan menggunakan pilihan. Dengan\n"
"Executor, kamu menyatakan niat itu secara eksplisit dengan menggunakan box beranotasi dan\n"
"samplex (dari [Samplomatic](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Sampler (twirling by using options):**\n"
msgstr "**Sampler (twirling dengan menggunakan pilihan):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Executor (twirling by using boxes and a samplex):**\n"
msgstr "**Executor (twirling dengan menggunakan box dan samplex):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because the template circuit and samplex are built on the client side, you can\n"
"inspect and sample them locally to verify the output before sending anything to\n"
"hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kerana circuit templat dan samplex dibina di sisi klien, kamu boleh\n"
"memeriksa dan mensampelnya secara tempatan untuk mengesahkan output sebelum menghantar apa-apa ke\n"
"perkakasan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"sample-local\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verification: Sample the template circuit locally {#verification-sample-the-template-circuit-locally}"
msgstr "Pengesahan: Sampel circuit templat secara tempatan {#verification-sample-the-template-circuit-locally}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can draw randomizations from the samplex and bind them to the template\n"
"circuit to confirm that the samplex is producing the parameter values you expect.\n"
"The parameter values returned by `samplex.sample` are directly compatible with the\n"
"template circuit's parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu boleh menarik rawakan dari samplex dan mengikatnya kepada circuit\n"
"templat untuk mengesahkan bahawa samplex menghasilkan nilai parameter yang kamu jangkakan.\n"
"Nilai parameter yang dikembalikan oleh `samplex.sample` adalah serasi secara langsung dengan\n"
"parameter circuit templat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To go further, you can verify that each randomization is logically equivalent to the\n"
"original circuit by, for example, converting both to `Operator` objects and comparing their unitary implementations (after\n"
"accounting for the `outputs[\"measurement_flips.<register>\"]` corrections that undo\n"
"measurement twirling), or by comparing expectation values from a local\n"
"`StatevectorSampler` or `StatevectorEstimator` run. See the Samplomatic\n"
"[Samplex inputs and outputs](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/guides/samplex_io.html)\n"
"guide for a complete walkthrough.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk melangkah lebih jauh, kamu boleh mengesahkan bahawa setiap rawakan adalah setara secara logik dengan\n"
"circuit asal dengan, contohnya, menukar kedua-duanya kepada objek `Operator` dan membandingkan pelaksanaan uniter mereka (selepas\n"
"mengambil kira pembetulan `outputs[\"measurement_flips.<register>\"]` yang membatalkan\n"
"twirling pengukuran), atau dengan membandingkan nilai jangkaan dari larian\n"
"`StatevectorSampler` atau `StatevectorEstimator` tempatan. Lihat panduan Samplomatic\n"
"[Input dan output Samplex](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/guides/samplex_io.html)\n"
"untuk panduan lengkap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"shots\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4. Change how shots are requested {#step-4-change-how-shots-are-requested}"
msgstr "Langkah 4. Ubah cara shot diminta {#step-4-change-how-shots-are-requested}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move shots from the PUB to `QuantumProgram(shots=...)`.  In Executor, `shots` applies to the whole job. Submit multiple jobs if you need different shot counts.\n"
msgstr "Pindahkan shot dari PUB kepada `QuantumProgram(shots=...)`. Dalam Executor, `shots` terpakai kepada keseluruhan kerja. Serahkan berbilang kerja jika kamu memerlukan bilangan shot yang berbeza.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5. Update options as necessary {#step-5-update-options-as-necessary}"
msgstr "Langkah 5. Kemaskini pilihan seperti yang diperlukan {#step-5-update-options-as-necessary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are fewer options available to Executor than Sampler, because\n"
"error-mitigation choices now live in your annotations and samplex instead of options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat lebih sedikit pilihan tersedia untuk Executor berbanding Sampler, kerana\n"
"pilihan mitigasi ralat kini berada dalam anotasi dan samplex kamu bukannya pilihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is also a structural difference in where settings live. \n"
msgstr "Terdapat juga perbezaan struktur dalam di mana tetapan berada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- With Sampler,\n"
"everything, including choices that affect result post-processing, is configured on\n"
"the primitive's options or in the PUB. \n"
msgstr ""
"- Dengan Sampler,\n"
"semuanya, termasuk pilihan yang menjejaskan pemprosesan pasca hasil, dikonfigurasi pada\n"
"pilihan primitif atau dalam PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- With Executor, choices that affect how the job\n"
"results are shaped and post-processed are set on the [`QuantumProgram`](/guides/executor-input-output#inputs-quantum-programs), not on\n"
"`ExecutorOptions`. \n"
msgstr ""
"- Dengan Executor, pilihan yang menjejaskan cara hasil\n"
"kerja dibentuk dan diproses pasca ditetapkan pada [`QuantumProgram`](/guides/executor-input-output#inputs-quantum-programs), bukan pada\n"
"`ExecutorOptions`.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "Examples:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Sampler      | Executor                    |\n"
"|--------------|-----------------------------|\n"
"| `shots`      | `QuantumProgram(shots=...)` |\n"
"| `meas_type` | `QuantumProgram(meas_level=...)` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sampler      | Executor                    |\n"
"|--------------|-----------------------------|\n"
"| `shots`      | `QuantumProgram(shots=...)` |\n"
"| `meas_type` | `QuantumProgram(meas_level=...)` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`ExecutorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options) holds only lower-level execution and environment\n"
"settings that don't change the structure of the returned data. It has three top-level groups:\n"
msgstr "[`ExecutorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options) hanya mengandungi tetapan pelaksanaan dan persekitaran peringkat rendah yang tidak mengubah struktur data yang dikembalikan. Ia mempunyai tiga kumpulan peringkat atas:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`environment` ([`EnvironmentOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-environment-options))\n"
msgstr "`environment` ([`EnvironmentOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-environment-options))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`execution` ([`ExecutionOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-execution-options)): Contains fewer options than with Sampler.  For example, there  is no `meas_type` Executor option. \n"
msgstr "`execution` ([`ExecutionOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-execution-options)): Mengandungi lebih sedikit pilihan berbanding Sampler. Sebagai contoh, tiada pilihan `meas_type` Executor.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`experimental`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options#experimental)\n"
msgstr "[`experimental`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options#experimental)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notably, the `twirling` and `dynamical_decoupling` options exist in Sampler but not Executor. Instead, those option values are expressed through the directed execution model.\n"
msgstr "Yang penting, pilihan `twirling` dan `dynamical_decoupling` wujud dalam Sampler tetapi tidak dalam Executor. Sebaliknya, nilai pilihan tersebut dinyatakan melalui model pelaksanaan berarah.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Example:**\n"
msgstr "**Example:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-job\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6. Update the `run` command {#step-6-update-the-run-command}"
msgstr "Langkah 6. Kemas kini arahan `run` {#step-6-update-the-run-command}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The input to an Executor job is the program, instead of PUBs.\n"
msgstr "Input kepada kerja Executor ialah program, bukannya PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7. Change how you access results {#step-7-change-how-you-access-results}"
msgstr "Langkah 7. Ubah cara anda mengakses keputusan {#step-7-change-how-you-access-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Executor, results are NumPy arrays, not `BitArray` objects.  Use the name string as the index (`result[0][\"meas\"]`) and get an `np.ndarray` back. There is no need to remember the `.data.<register>` attribute path.\n"
msgstr "Dalam Executor, keputusan adalah array NumPy, bukan objek `BitArray`. Gunakan rentetan nama sebagai indeks (`result[0][\"meas\"]`) dan anda akan mendapat semula `np.ndarray`. Tiada keperluan untuk mengingati laluan atribut `.data.<register>`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update from Sampler to Executor, change `result[i].data.<reg> (BitArray)` to `result[i][\"<reg>\"] (np.ndarray)`, then rewrite `get_counts`-based post-processing as NumPy operations.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengemas kini daripada Sampler kepada Executor, tukar `result[i].data.<reg> (BitArray)` kepada `result[i][\"<reg>\"] (np.ndarray)`, kemudian tulis semula pemprosesan pasca berasaskan `get_counts` sebagai operasi NumPy.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task                          | Sampler                                          | Executor                                    |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Get register data             | `result[0].data.meas`                            | `result[0][\"meas\"]`                         |\n"
"| Data type                     | `BitArray`                                        | `np.ndarray`                                |\n"
"| Counts dictionary             | `result[0].data.meas.get_counts()`              | Post-process the array manually             |\n"
"| Multiple registers            | `result[0].data.<name>` per register             | `result[0][\"<name>\"]` per register          |\n"
"| CircuitItem array shape       | -                                               | `(parameter_sets, shots, register_bits)`    |\n"
"| SamplexItem array shape       | -                                               | `(randomizations, parameter_sets, shots, register_bits)` |\n"
"| Undo measurement twirling     | Automatic                                        | `result[i][\"measurement_flips.<name>\"]` + XOR |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Task                          | Sampler                                          | Executor                                    |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Get register data             | `result[0].data.meas`                            | `result[0][\"meas\"]`                         |\n"
"| Data type                     | `BitArray`                                        | `np.ndarray`                                |\n"
"| Counts dictionary             | `result[0].data.meas.get_counts()`              | Post-process the array manually             |\n"
"| Multiple registers            | `result[0].data.<name>` per register             | `result[0][\"<name>\"]` per register          |\n"
"| CircuitItem array shape       | -                                               | `(parameter_sets, shots, register_bits)`    |\n"
"| SamplexItem array shape       | -                                               | `(randomizations, parameter_sets, shots, register_bits)` |\n"
"| Undo measurement twirling     | Automatic                                        | `result[i][\"measurement_flips.<name>\"]` + XOR |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Sampler's `BitArray` offers helpers (`get_counts`, `slice_bits`, `slice_shots`, `expectation_values`, and post-selection masks). Executor returns raw NumPy arrays so you can perform this post-processing with standard NumPy operations.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"twirled-results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8. Handle twirled results (bit-flip corrections) {#step-8-handle-twirled-results-bit-flip-corrections}"
msgstr "Langkah 8. Kendalikan keputusan twirled (pembetulan bit-flip) {#step-8-handle-twirled-results-bit-flip-corrections}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you apply measurement twirling through a `SamplexItem`, Executor returns the raw\n"
"(twirled) measurements plus the bit-flip corrections needed to undo the twirling.\n"
"You need to apply them manually; nothing is corrected implicitly. \n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila anda menggunakan twirling pengukuran melalui `SamplexItem`, Executor mengembalikan pengukuran mentah\n"
"(twirled) berserta pembetulan bit-flip yang diperlukan untuk membatalkan twirling.\n"
"Anda perlu menerapkannya secara manual; tiada apa yang dibetulkan secara tersirat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When using Executor, undo twirling explicitly by using the `measurement_flips.<reg>` corrections and an XOR, as shown in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Apabila menggunakan Executor, batalkan twirling secara eksplisit dengan menggunakan pembetulan `measurement_flips.<reg>` dan XOR, seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam contoh berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is no equivalent step in Sampler because it undoes twirling for you.\n"
msgstr "Tiada langkah setara dalam Sampler kerana ia membatalkan twirling untuk anda secara automatik.\n"

